        "id": 215595,
        "name": "MindWanderer",
        "username": "MindWanderer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-03-23T19:31:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We also don't totally understand what the Mist Storm is.&nbsp; Since it's the Mist Storm Universe, I'm guessing that the Mist Storm is either the direct instrument of its destruction or at least a proximal cause.</p><p>I'm hoping an RPG module somehow permits travel across realities again, allowing Haka to be rescued (as well as La Comodora and possibly others).&nbsp; Haka's story just ending along with the reality he's stranded in is somehow an even more depressing end than what most of the Tactics characters get, and it would make Arataki's story get weird with no explanation she can see.&nbsp; Unless the bond between the two of them is so strong that even the destruction of an entire universe can't kill him, and he gets stranded outside of space and time?</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:47:04.781Z",
