        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/speedyolrac/{size}/1918_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-03-23T20:03:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If you want to draw parallels this tactics feels like what Marvel tries to do with Ultimates.</p>\n<p>I was very confused about have two time lines until I started to read a bit of it. It was ok. Gave a breath of fresh air to everyone.</p>\n<p>And when Mist Storm Universe gets canceled, the editor will take all the good things and add them to the main time line.</p>\n<p>Exhibit A<br>\nMiles Moralis, the new Spider-Man, is now in the main time line.</p>\n<p>Exhibit B<br>\nSingularly, Doom world resident, made it the main timeline.</p>\n<p>No need to worry about our Haka. The writer will find a way for his to exist. (If it makes money). I mean Old man Hawkeye exist.</p>",
