      {
        "id": 215597,
        "name": "Foote",
        "username": "Foote",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-03-23T21:30:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"MindWanderer\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/48/4816_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MindWanderer:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>We also don't totally understand what the Mist Storm is.&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>We dont, but I think there are some small educated guesses we can make without getting into too much trouble.</p>\n<p>For instance, I think that the mist-gate spell that cost Nightmist her life had some unintended lingering effects. There is no earth shattering thoughts there, but it feels like a safe bet to me. If we accept that as being a strong possibility, we can make other far less safe, but far more fun, inferences from there.</p>\n<p>Maybe the wind blew the wrong direction right after the Tactics Universe split off and the mists never dispersed properly, causing them to eventually accumulate, multiply, and spread? Maybe there is a yet to be revealed player from another universe causing and directing the mists? Maybe the curse of Nightmist's is looking for a new host? Maybe it's just Guise?&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Felt good to get back into speculation mode for a bit. Skipped my power and draw phases for it, but I think it's worth.</p>",
